 [resources/shelves/README.md](https://github.com/mikespub-org/seblucas-cops/tree/main/resources/shelves/README.md). Server-side shelves intend to replicate most of the features on the server-side per session/user/shared, so that you don't need to share or export/import local shelves between devices. They should also work for devices with limited or no Javascript support.\r\n\r\nNote: feedback and contributions are welcome in the form of issues and/or pull requests :-)\r\n\r\n## Change log\r\n### 4.6.1 - 20261026 Add virtual shelves + fix issues\r\n  * Changes in config/default.php file:\r\n    - new $config['cops_use_client_shelves'] to use client-side shelves\r\n    - new $config['cops_use_server_shelves'] to use server-side shelves (WIP)\r\n    - new $config['cops_twig_cache_directory'] to cache compiled Twig templates\r\n  * Experiment with server-side virtual shelves in 'twigged' template (WIP)\r\n  * Add option to cache compiled Twig templates for server-side rendering\r\n  * Use sqlite function to filter queries by book idlist for shelves\r\n  * Add random books option to bootstrap5 menu - see PR #184 from @dunxd\r\n  * Remove 'bootstrap' template in this release - see issue #181 from @mikespub\r\n  * Clean up provide_kepub checks and Ignore_Title.kepub.epub in URLs - see issue #182 from @dunxd\r\n  * Try client-side virtual shelves (favorites) in supported templates\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mikespub-org/seblucas-cops/compare/4.5.4...4.6.1","upstream_url":"https://github.com/mikespub-org/seblucas-cops/releases/tag/4.6.1"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","PHP_INI_SCAN_DIR=:/config/php","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["443/tcp","80/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir"